; Play the two expansion words on the isolated relay outputs.
ORG 0
again:  LDA entry
        P4A 0
        ANZ
        VZG 250
        VZG 250
        LDA exit
        P4A 0
        ANZ
        VZG 250
        VZG 250
        AKO 0
        P4A 0
        ANZ
        VZG 250
        VZG 250
        SPU again

ORG 128
entry:  DATA 1
ORG 255
exit:   DATA 2
